    "Scan of the 1967 edition of the Niwot, Colorado, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1950; aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1967; photo revised in 1979; last revised in 1979; printed in 1988.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.2 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
